        {"entry_id":"music","dedupe_key":"m2","sender":"Iris","account_id":"iris","kind":"self_output","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T09:00:06+08:00","content":"我喜欢轻柔的纯音乐，尤其是钢琴独奏，工作时听着很舒服。"},
        {"entry_id":"music","dedupe_key":"m3","sender":"南桥","account_id":"nanqiao","kind":"message","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T09:00:12+08:00","content":"好，我不急着放歌，先整理一下桌面。"},
