        {"entry_id":"dinner","dedupe_key":"m6","sender":"周禾","account_id":"he","kind":"message","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T12:01:10+08:00","content":"我刚才试了一下头像功能，马上换回去。"},
        {"entry_id":"dinner","dedupe_key":"m7","sender":"梁柚","account_id":"you","kind":"message","occurred_at":"2026-10-04T12:01:18+08:00","content":"哈哈，我还以为进错群了。"},
